		{
			description: ["The whispers grow stronger as you forge this peculiar material. Void Steel appears to absorb light itself, a manifestation of the space between stars that the Creators once traversed. Each ingot feels unnaturally cold in your hands, as if it's drawing energy from your very being. With this forbidden material, you edge closer to understanding the Creators' most dangerous secrets."]
