			x: -4.5d
			y: 2.0d
		}
		{
			description: ["The process of hammering Void Steel into sheets creates an unsettling resonance, as if reality itself protests against your actions. These sheets are impossibly thin yet stronger than diamond, capable of bending light and perhaps even more fundamental forces. The Creators used similar materials to construct vessels that could traverse the void between dimensions. What will you build with such power?"]
			id: "5775811F8BACF99E"
