		}
		{
			description: ["As you delve deeper into the mysteries of Void Steel, you sense a growing unease. This material should not exist in our realm—it defies natural laws and seems to resonate with something beyond comprehension. The Creators left warnings about such materials in ancient texts. Are you prepared for the consequences of wielding what was never meant for mortal hands?"]
